+These tests run the actual ALNS solver and verify that the temperature
+calibration works correctly in a production scenario.
+
+The canonical ALNS (now used by HMLNS) has a bug fix for non-positive
+initial profits: it uses scale=1.0 as a fallback instead of skipping
+calibration. These tests verify the fix works end-to-end.
